 "issue": {
  "id": 3488769619,
  "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/googleapis/librarian/issues/2490",
  "body": "Currently all methods that can stream results (e.g. [`StreamGenerateContent`](https://github.com/googleapis/googleapis/blob/7f0c1e5d7a45598b92d2f08e02000f005b757194/google/ai/generativelanguage/v1/generative_service.proto#L64)) have a corresponding generated Dart binding, e.g.\n\n```dart\n  /// Generates a [streamed response](https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/text-generation?lang=python#generate-a-text-stream)\n  /// from the model given an input `GenerateContentRequest`.\n  Stream<GenerateContentResponse> streamGenerateContent(\n    GenerateContentRequest request,\n  ) {\n    final url = Uri.https(_host, '/v1/${request.model}:streamGenerateContent');\n    return _client\n        .postStreaming(url, body: request)\n        .map(GenerateContentResponse.fromJson);\n  }\n```\n\nBut not all streaming methods support Server-sent events (SSE), which is the implementation supported by Dart.\n\nSo instead whitelist streamed methods known to support SSE.",
  "type": null,
  "user": {
   "id": 8851008,
   "url": "https://api.github.com/users/brianquinlan",
   "type": "User",
   "login": "brianquinlan",
   "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg4NTEwMDg=",
   "html_url": "https://github.com/brianquinlan",
   "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/brianquinlan/gists{/gist_id}",
